# Files agents may create but not modify. One bash glob per line, relative to the repo root.
# * matches across folders, so e2e/* covers everything under e2e/.
# Agents propose changes by writing the new version to .shipinetics/pending/<path>, and a human
# applies it with: shipinetics-config apply. To edit these directly for a whole session, start
# Claude Code with SHIPINETICS_UNLOCK=1.
# .shipinetics/* covers the policy lists and config, so agents can't loosen their own rules.

.shipinetics/*
e2e/acceptance/*
*-snapshots/*
perf/baselines/*

# The design system, if the user wants token changes to need a human (setup asks).
